<title>TAIWAN: Acer buys TI notebook unit.</title>
<headline>Acer buys TI notebook unit.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's computer giant, Acer Inc, said on Thursday that it has purchased the notebook computer business unit of U.S.-based Texas Instruments.</p>
<p>An Acer statement said both sides declined to give the amout of the deal.</p>
